OL,3,GNEWSAFen rail line has never been
OL,4,Aworse, say passengers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA railway passenger group is calling
OL,7,Ffor urgent improvements to train
OL,8,Fservices connecting Norfolk and
OL,9,FCambridgeshire after recording a steep
OL,10,Frise in the number of cancellations.
OL,12,FGreat Northern, which runs services
OL,13,Fbetween King's Lynn and Cambridge, says
OL,14,Fthe hot, dry summer has been a major
OL,15,Ffactor, with failing air conditioning
OL,16,Fsystems on trains and damaged tracks.
OL,18,FThe Fen Line Users Association (FLUA),
OL,19,Fwhich monitors disruption on the
OL,20,Fcross-county line, found that in July
OL,21,F380 services were cancelled - up from
OL,22,F177 in June.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
